source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A brace opener finds no closer when the only bare candidate is followed by a word rune, so the run stays literal.
-- input.jira --
a{*}b*c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a{*}b*c</p>
-- want.md --
a{\*}b\*c
-- warnings.json --
[]
